{"id":"cine","lemma":"cine","pos":"noun","rank":914,"glosses":["cinema, moviehouse","film (when specifying types of films)","cinema; A sophisticated or exemplary film, representative of the art of cinema."],"ipa":"/ˈθine/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cines"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cine.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Puedo ir al cine contigo?","en":"Can I go to the movies with you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798333","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"with you"}]},{"text":"Voy al cine todas las semanas.","en":"I go to the movies every week.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/557499","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"week","l":"semana"}]},{"text":"Fui al cine con mi hermano.","en":"I went to the movies with my brother.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568145","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"}]},{"text":"Mañana no iré al cine.","en":"I'm not going to the movies tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/554760","words":[{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ayer fueron al cine.","en":"Yesterday, they went to the movies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524929","words":[{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}